## 1. System Requirements

### BCM-REQ-001: System Initialization
- The system SHALL initialize all configured BSW modules within 100 ms after power-up
- The system SHALL enter the configured default operating mode (SLEEP -> RUN) within 200 ms
- The system SHALL perform a startup diagnostic check on all critical peripherals

#### Reason
系统初始化是安全启动的基础，确保 ECU 在上电后按预期进入运行状态。

### BCM-REQ-002: Diagnostic Communication
- The system SHALL support UDS diagnostic services via ISO 14229-1 over CAN
- The system SHALL support DiagnosticSessionControl (0x10), EcuReset (0x11), ReadDTCInformation (0x19)
- The system SHALL support ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22) and WriteDataByIdentifier (0x2E)
- The system SHALL respond to diagnostic requests within 50 ms

#### Reason
诊断通信是量产 ECU 的强制要求，用于产线标定和售后诊断。

